WEBVTT

00:13:59.796 --> 00:14:02.116
Adesso la vostra parte.

00:14:02.196 --> 00:14:08.876
(Tiene il tempo)

00:14:08.916 --> 00:14:14.916
(Tiene il tempo)

00:14:14.956 --> 00:14:16.996
Bravi. Bene. Ottimo.

00:14:17.036 --> 00:14:18.796
(Applausi)

00:14:18.876 --> 00:14:21.036
Allora...
(Applausi)

00:14:21.076 --> 00:14:22.916
Grazie.
(Applausi)

00:14:22.956 --> 00:14:28.556
Quindi... (Applausi)
Tre versioni... (Applausi)

00:14:28.596 --> 00:14:31.876
(Ride)